### VS Code "REST Client" extension. Set host:
@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Login as the seeded citizen
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "citizen@relief.test", "password": "Citizen@12345" }

### 2. Submit a request (paste the token from step 1)
POST {{host}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_CITIZEN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "category": "Medicine", "description": "My father needs insulin. We are trapped by the flood.", "peopleAffected": 4, "latitude": 6.9271, "longitude": 79.8612 }

### 3. Login as coordinator
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "coordinator@relief.test", "password": "Coord@12345" }

### 4. See pending AI suggestions (wait ~3s after step 2: the outbox worker runs every 3 seconds)
GET {{host}}/api/ai-recommendations?status=PendingReview
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN

### 5. Decide (Approve / Modify / Reject / Defer)
POST {{host}}/api/ai-recommendations/1/decision
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "Modify", "finalValueJson": "{\"category\":\"Medicine\",\"urgency\":4}", "reason": "Patient is stable, urgency 4 is enough" }

### 6. Dashboard metrics
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/metrics
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN

###################### MORE MODULES ######################
### Public shelters (no login)
GET {{host}}/api/shelters/public

### Shelter suggestions for request 1 (login as coordinator/shelter admin)
GET {{host}}/api/shelters/suggest?requestId=1
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN

### Allocate shelter (capacity can never be exceeded)
POST {{host}}/api/shelters/1/allocations
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "requestId": 1, "peopleCount": 4 }

### Inventory + shortage resolution (login as logistics@relief.test / Logistics@123)
GET {{host}}/api/resources/inventory
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_LOGISTICS_TOKEN

###
POST {{host}}/api/resources/resolve-shortage
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_LOGISTICS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "inventoryId": 3, "requests": [ { "requestId": 1, "quantity": 8 }, { "requestId": 2, "quantity": 8 } ], "partnerOrganisationId": 1 }

### Duplicates awaiting review
GET {{host}}/api/duplicates
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN

### Volunteer registers (any logged-in user), then volunteer coordinator verifies
POST {{host}}/api/volunteers/register
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_CITIZEN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "baseLatitude": 7.2, "baseLongitude": 79.87, "hasVehicle": true, "skills": [ { "skillId": 1, "level": 4 } ] }

### Donate (sandbox, no real payment). Same paymentRef twice = one donation
POST {{host}}/api/donations
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_CITIZEN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "campaignId": 1, "type": "Monetary", "amount": 5000, "currency": "LKR", "paymentRef": "TEST-001" }

### Public transparency
GET {{host}}/api/donations/transparency/1

### Audit log (admin / coordinator)
GET {{host}}/api/audit?entityType=AssistanceRequest
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN

### Geocode an address (OpenStreetMap)
GET {{host}}/api/geo/geocode?address=Negombo, Sri Lanka
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_CITIZEN_TOKEN

###################### BRIEF GAPS: NEW ENDPOINTS ######################
### Crisis + operational areas (coordinator)
GET {{host}}/api/crises
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN

###
POST {{host}}/api/crises/1/areas
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kalutara", "centreLat": 6.5854, "centreLng": 79.9607, "radiusKm": 20 }

### Household profile (citizen). Medical notes + address are encrypted in the database
PUT {{host}}/api/households/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_CITIZEN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "memberCount": 4, "hasChildren": true, "hasElderly": true, "hasDisability": false, "medicalNotes": "Father: diabetic", "address": "12 Lake Rd, Negombo" }

### Upload evidence (use a real jpg/png/pdf; Swagger UI is easiest for multipart)
# POST {{host}}/api/requests/1/attachments  (form-data, field "file")

### Feedback after the request is Fulfilled
POST {{host}}/api/requests/1/feedback
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_CITIZEN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 5, "comment": "Help arrived quickly" }

### Public alerts + safety guidance (no login)
GET {{host}}/api/alerts/public
###
GET {{host}}/api/alerts/guidance?type=flood

### Publish an emergency announcement (coordinator) and notify all citizens
POST {{host}}/api/alerts
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Flood warning", "body": "Move to higher ground in low-lying areas.", "severity": "Critical", "language": "en", "notifyUsers": true }

### AI support assistant (no login, rate limited)
POST {{host}}/api/assistant/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "How do I ask for food?", "language": "en" }

### Coordinator monitoring: open / overdue / escalated
GET {{host}}/api/requests/monitor
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN

### Assign a request to an organisation
PATCH {{host}}/api/requests/1/assign
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "organisationId": 1, "note": "Medical team" }

### Critical decisions: second approval (four-eyes)
GET {{host}}/api/ai-recommendations/pending-approval
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN
###
POST {{host}}/api/ai-recommendations/1/second-approval
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "approve": true }

### Post-incident review of AI decisions
GET {{host}}/api/ai-recommendations/review?onlyOverrides=true
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN

### Suspicious requests (flagged, never auto-rejected)
GET {{host}}/api/anomalies
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN

### Analytics
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/forecast?category=Food&days=3
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN
###
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/summary?language=en
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN
###
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/coverage?radiusKm=10
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN
###
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/shortages
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN
###
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/kpis?days=7
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_COORDINATOR_TOKEN

### Dispatch with route + ETA (logistics)
POST {{host}}/api/resources/allocations/1/dispatch
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_LOGISTICS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ }

### Map: reverse geocode and route
GET {{host}}/api/geo/reverse?lat=6.9271&lon=79.8612
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_CITIZEN_TOKEN
###
GET {{host}}/api/geo/route?fromLat=6.9271&fromLon=79.8612&toLat=7.2008&toLon=79.8737
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_CITIZEN_TOKEN
